%!PS-Adobe-3.0 EPSF-3.0
%%Creator: (XnView)
%%Title: (D:\LYCEE\- BTS SNIR1\08-Modelisation signal\Images\cossin.ps)
%%CreationDate: (Thu Apr 15 11:15:17 2021)
